Package: moonlight-switch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: XITRIX
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, zlib1g, libgl1, libegl1,
 libgles2, libdrm2, libva2, libva-drm2, libva-x11-2, libvdpau1,
 libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcb-dri3-0, libfontconfig1,
 libfreetype6
Homepage: https://github.com/XITRIX/Moonlight-Switch
Description: Controller-friendly Moonlight game-streaming client
 Moonlight-Switch streams games from a Sunshine or GameStream host and
 supports keyboard, mouse, gamepad, and hardware-accelerated video decoding.
